WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.443
Today is the last word, and then a story.

2
00:00:02.893 --> 00:00:05.472
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

3
00:00:05.972 --> 00:00:07.100
Say the word. Said.

4
00:00:10.489 --> 00:00:11.430
The word is said.

5
00:00:12.130 --> 00:00:14.583
The first letter and the last letter play fair.

6
00:00:15.033 --> 00:00:21.665
The middle part is two letters that make one sound. It is the sound in the middle of bed. That is the heart part.

7
00:00:22.115 --> 00:00:23.731
These are today's two pages.

8
00:00:24.181 --> 00:00:30.955
Your child traces the word and draws the heart. Then step away, and press play on the sound track for job two.

9
00:00:31.405 --> 00:00:37.712
When the page is done, turn to the story. Every word in it is one your child has mapped, or can sound out.

10
00:00:38.162 --> 00:00:42.252
If a word is stuck, do not say it. Say: tap it. Which part is the heart?

11
00:00:42.702 --> 00:00:46.586
Let your child read the story to you. Then to someone else in the family.
